OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 7 JUN
OL,4,G0900FSunday Morning
OL,5,     GJoin Sarah Walker for a delicious
OL,6,     GSunday mix of sparkling classics,
OL,7,     Gfrom heart-melting choral works
OL,8,     Gand romantic orchestral gems to
OL,9,     Grestorative piano music.
OL,10,G1200FPrivate Passions
OL,11,     GMichael Berkeley's guest is the
OL,12,     Gwriter Sofka Zinovieff.
OL,13,G1330FMusic Map
OL,14,     GSara Mohr Pietsch immerses us in
OL,15,     Gthe sound world of Totus Tuus by
OL,16,     Gthe Polish composer Henryk
OL,17,     GGorecki, composed in 1987 in
OL,18,     Ghonour of a visit to Poland by
OL,19,     GPope John Paul II.
