OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 7 JUN
OL,4,G1500FMark Radcliffe's Nature Ramblings
OL,5,     GIn the second part of Mark
OL,6,     GRadcliffe's Nature Ramblings, he
OL,7,     Gfeatures music inspired by
OL,8,     Gmountains, including Grieg,
OL,9,     GLiszt, Mussorgsky and Hawkwind.
OL,10,G1600FJazz Record Requests
OL,11,     GAlyn Shipton presents jazz
OL,12,     Grecords of all styles as
OL,13,     Grequested by you.
OL,14,G1700FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,15,     GAs part of Wigmore Hall's 125th
OL,16,     GAnniversary Festival, the young
OL,17,     GVienna-born pianist, Lukas
OL,18,     GSternath, performs Liszt's
OL,19,     Gvirtuosic Funerailles and
OL,20,     GSchubert's final Piano Sonata.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
